{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661590/extras/join_discord.gif?t=1745499217\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">While you had found tranquility, secluded from the world, duty calls you back : your best friend has been taken by a corrupted tyrant for ominous designs. Soon, you are bound to break your oath of peace and take back in hand your rusted trusted sword, a magical entity by your side to alleviate your burden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this roguelike deckbuilder game your spells are represented by tiles. Place them in a timeline where you can foresee your opponent intents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661590/extras/fight.gif?t=1745499217\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But be careful of your enemies adapting to your strategy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661590/extras/archer.gif?t=1745499217\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Modify your tiles with upgrades along the way. Every tiles can get any upgrades, find your own unique destructive combos</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661590/extras/devil.gif?t=1745499217\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Barter better tiles with the trader</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet with the blacksmith to strengthen your timeline</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Transform the power of your deck with relics you will find when defeating tougher enemies and bosses</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Carve your path to the Devious King and discover what lies behind its madness</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"